#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/processes.rs:83
msgid "A build or compile. Will finish sooner if left alone."
msgstr "Izgradnja ili prevođenje. Završit će prije ako se ostavi na miru."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/tuning.rs:1258
msgid "A game reads switches such as WINE_FULLSCREEN_FSR and ENABLE_VKBASALT from its environment, which it gets from whatever starts it. The file is read at login; the systemd user manager is updated at once, so a launcher opened afterwards passes them on. A launcher already open (Steam) keeps its old environment until it is reopened. A Turbo preset adds its own switches only while it is in force."
msgstr "Igra čita prekidače kao što su WINE_FULLSCREEN_FSR i ENABLE_VKBASALT iz svog okruženja, koje dobiva od onoga što je pokreće. Datoteka se čita pri prijavi; korisnički upravitelj systemd ažurira se odmah, pa ih pokretač otvoren nakon toga prosljeđuje. Pokretač koji je već otvoren (Steam) zadržava staro okruženje dok ga ponovno ne otvorite. Turbo predložak dodaje vlastite prekidače samo dok je na snazi."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/problems.rs:214
msgid "A game runs under Turbo, but the power profile is not performance. Check the game's profile has performance mode on."
msgstr "Igra radi uz Turbo, ali profil napajanja nije performance. Provjerite ima li profil igre uključen način rada performansi."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:243
msgid "A game runs under Turbo, but the profile is %s"
msgstr "Igra radi uz Turbo, ali profil je %s"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/optimization.rs:177
msgid "A game without a profile of its own gets exactly these settings: this page is the Global profile, used by every game marked “Without a profile”. A game's profile replaces only what it sets; everything else still follows this page."
msgstr "Igra bez vlastitog profila dobiva upravo ove postavke: ova stranica je Globalni profil, koji koristi svaka igra označena „Bez profila”. Profil igre zamjenjuje samo ono što sam postavlja; sve ostalo i dalje prati ovu stranicu."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:263
msgid "A guided profile: every option explained, for a game you pick"
msgstr "Vođeni profil: svaka opcija objašnjena, za igru koju odaberete"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/scheduler_info.rs:33
msgid "A highly robust, general-purpose scheduler that ensures extreme fairness. It guarantees that no background app gets 'starved' while keeping the foreground responsive."
msgstr "Vrlo robustan raspoređivač opće namjene koji osigurava iznimnu pravednost. Jamči da nijedna pozadinska aplikacija ne 'gladuje', a prednji plan ostaje responzivan."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/pipeline.rs:468
msgid "A look, not a speed-up: it costs a little GPU time. Evidence: libvkbasalt mapped in the game."
msgstr "Izgled, a ne ubrzanje: troši malo vremena GPU-a. Dokaz: libvkbasalt mapiran u igri."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/pipeline.rs:150
msgid "A micro-compositor around the game: scaling, frame limit, a stable fullscreen"
msgstr "Mikro-kompozitor oko igre: skaliranje, ograničenje sličica, stabilan cijeli zaslon"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/turbo_presets.rs:54
msgid "A native Linux game is capped only when BiGame-mode starts it (Profiles → Launch)."
msgstr "Izvorna Linux igra ograničava se samo kad je BiGame-mode pokrene (Profili → Pokreni)."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/tutorial.rs:211
msgid "A preset is chosen with Turbo off and ends when Turbo does. Steam opened before Turbo gets the preset when it is reopened, and Home offers to reopen it."
msgstr "Predložak se bira dok je Turbo isključen i završava kad završi Turbo. Steam otvoren prije Turba dobiva predložak kad ga ponovno otvorite, a Početna nudi da ga ponovno otvori."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/welcome.rs:69
msgid "A profile for every game"
msgstr "Profil za svaku igru"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profile_wizard.rs:109
msgid "A sched-ext scheduler can smooth frame times in some games. Leave it on the general configuration unless a game stutters; the (i) buttons explain each choice."
msgstr "sched-ext raspoređivač može izgladiti vremena sličica u nekim igrama. Ostavite ga na općoj konfiguraciji osim ako igra zapinje; gumbi (i) objašnjavaju svaki izbor."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:52
msgid "A scheduler tuned for games, loaded by falcond through scx_loader"
msgstr "Raspoređivač podešen za igre, koji falcond učitava putem scx_loader"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/report.rs:100
msgid "A system-wide setting BiGame-mode's own planner considers. It is applied only if nothing else owns it and it is known to help."
msgstr "Postavka za cijeli sustav koju razmatra planer samog BiGame-mode. Primjenjuje se samo ako njome ne upravlja ništa drugo i ako je poznato da pomaže."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/scheduler_info.rs:81
msgid "A testing scheduler that makes scheduling decisions completely randomly. Used by developers to uncover hidden concurrency bugs. Do not use for gaming!"
msgstr "Testni raspoređivač koji odluke o raspoređivanju donosi potpuno nasumično. Programeri ga koriste za otkrivanje skrivenih grešaka istodobnosti. Ne koristite ga za igranje!"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/processes.rs:89
msgid "A virtual machine or container. Closing it may interrupt work."
msgstr "Virtualni stroj ili spremnik. Zatvaranje može prekinuti rad."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/processes.rs:86
msgid "A web browser. Tabs playing video or running scripts cost the most."
msgstr "Web preglednik. Najviše troše kartice koje reproduciraju video ili izvode skripte."

#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.metainfo.xml:49
msgid "A welcome screen, a rewritten About and Help; Tuning with Gamescope always in view, standard resolutions and the main screen's size, and vkBasalt looks (CAS or the Nara Linux style); game profiles with the same rows as Tuning, reaching Steam and Heroic games; Launch (Turbo) through every launcher and Reopen for one opened before the preset; a redesigned AI Graphics window that follows a game's launcher stub and sees upscalers built into the executable; background programs can be closed or paused, a measured DNS applied with a backup, and falcond handed back and taken again."
msgstr "Zaslon dobrodošlice, prepisani O aplikaciji i Pomoć; Podešavanje u kojem je Gamescope uvijek na vidiku, sa standardnim razlučivostima, veličinom glavnog zaslona i vkBasalt izgledima (CAS ili stil Nara Linux); profili igara s istim redcima kao Podešavanje, koji dosežu Steam i Heroic igre; Pokreni (Turbo) kroz svaki pokretač i Ponovno otvori za onaj otvoren prije predloška; redizajnirani prozor AI grafika koji prati mali program što ga pokreće pokretač igre i vidi upscalere ugrađene u izvršnu datoteku; pozadinski programi mogu se zatvoriti ili pauzirati, izmjereni DNS primjenjuje se uz sigurnosnu kopiju, a falcond se vraća i ponovno preuzima."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:1515
msgid "A zip in Downloads with what this page found, what was planned and placed, and the logs — home folder, user and host names masked. For a bug report."
msgstr "Zip arhiva u mapi Preuzimanja s onim što je ova stranica pronašla, što je planirano i postavljeno te sa zapisnicima — kućna mapa, korisničko ime i naziv računala su skriveni. Za prijavu greške."

