msgstr "BiGame-mode"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/optimization.rs:86
msgid "BiGame-mode and falcond leave the driver's current preference alone."
msgstr "BiGame-mode i falcond ne mijenjaju trenutnu preferenciju upravljačkog programa."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/extras.rs:258
msgid "BiGame-mode asks it to quit, as closing its window would (SIGTERM). Anything you have not saved in it may be lost. A program that ignores the request keeps running: nothing forces it."
msgstr "BiGame-mode ga moli da se zatvori, kao što bi to učinilo zatvaranje njegova prozora (SIGTERM). Sve što u njemu niste spremili može se izgubiti. Program koji zanemari zahtjev nastavlja raditi: ništa ga ne prisiljava."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/game_fields.rs:98
msgid "BiGame-mode cannot start this game, and its launcher takes no launch settings from BiGame-mode: it gets Tuning's, Wine FSR and vkBasalt from the session environment."
msgstr "BiGame-mode ne može pokrenuti ovu igru, a njezin pokretač ne prima postavke pokretanja od BiGame-mode: postavke iz Podešavanja, Wine FSR i vkBasalt dobiva iz okruženja sesije."

