msgstr "BiGame-mode je postavio %s; prethodne postavke su sačuvane"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/measure_dialog.rs:59
msgid "BiGame-mode would change nothing on this machine, so %t would be measured against itself. The game's profile is still applied by falcond whenever it runs."
msgstr "BiGame-mode na ovom računalu ne bi ništa promijenio, pa bi se %t mjerila sama sa sobom. Profil igre falcond i dalje primjenjuje kad god ona radi."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/graphics/report.rs:430
