msgstr "Popis igara BiGame-mode navodi API kojim ova igra zadano iscrtava"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:707
msgid "BiGame-mode's own choices for this game — its launch settings, MangoHud and AI Graphics — kept in your configuration, with no password. What BiGame-mode wrote into Steam's launch options or Heroic's settings is recorded there, so it changes or removes exactly that."
msgstr "Vlastiti izbori BiGame-mode za ovu igru — njezine postavke pokretanja, MangoHud i AI grafika — čuvaju se u vašoj konfiguraciji, bez lozinke. Ono što je BiGame-mode zapisao u Steam opcije pokretanja ili Heroicove postavke ovdje je zabilježeno, pa mijenja ili uklanja upravo to."

