#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/settings.rs:365
msgid "Older versions named profiles after the game's title, which falcond can never match, and stored settings falcond ignores. Fixing renames each one to the game's real process and keeps only falcond's settings. Every profile is backed up first to ~/.local/state/bigame-mode. falcond's own profiles are never touched."
msgstr "Starije verzije imenovale su profile prema naslovu igre, koji falcond nikad ne može prepoznati, i spremale postavke koje falcond zanemaruje. Popravak preimenuje svaki profil prema stvarnom procesu igre i zadržava samo postavke za falcond. Svaki se profil najprije sigurnosno kopira u ~/.local/state/bigame-mode. Vlastiti profili falconda nikad se ne diraju."

